- **Result**: JO→AMMC→WED subgraph (~1,954 neurons) shows STDP-based conditioning and extinction
- **Protocol**: 200 Hz JO-E forcing (courtship song proxy) + DAN-proxy WED forcing → Hebbian LTP × 8 trials; then song alone → anti-Hebbian LTD × 12 trials
